WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.611
Alerts watch a metric and notify you

00:00:03.611 --> 00:00:06.453
Recommended starter alerts turn on with Enable

00:00:06.453 --> 00:00:08.894
Click Create alert

00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:15.580
Name it and pick the scope

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:28.273
Set the trigger

00:00:28.273 --> 00:00:49.409
Choose who to notify

00:00:49.409 --> 00:00:53.260
Click Save

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.062
The new alert is on

00:00:55.062 --> 00:00:57.982
Agent alerts watch one agent, even its tool calls

00:00:57.982 --> 00:01:01.633
Turn an alert off or on with its switch
